     3472             SIZE 38 BY .62 AT ROW 11.95 COL 4 WIDGET-ID 48
     3473             FGCOLOR 4
     3474        "Выбор производителя" VIEW-AS TEXT
     3475             SIZE 23 BY .62 AT ROW 3.86 COL 4 WIDGET-ID 30
     3476             FGCOLOR 4
     3477        "Вывести отчет в формате:" VIEW-AS TEXT
     3478             SIZE 28 BY .71 AT ROW 15.86 COL 4 WIDGET-ID 56
     3479        RECT-13 AT ROW 1.29 COL 2 WIDGET-ID 18
     3480       WITH 1 DOWN NO-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER OVERLAY
